OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss' departure
OL,4,Ainevitable, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe departure of Travelodge's boss was
OL,7,Finevitable after a woman's sexual
OL,8,Fassault at one of its hotels was
OL,9,Freported, an MP said.
OL,11,FJo Boydell stepped down as the
OL,12,FThame-based chain's CEO, having been
OL,13,Fcriticised for its handling of a
OL,14,Fcatalogue of complaints over safety
OL,15,Fissues. The company is reviewing its
OL,16,Fsecurity measures.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,332,330,200,160,0,100
