OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss' departure
OL,4,Ainevitable, MP says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe woman staying at the company's
OL,7,FMaidenhead hotel was attacked in
OL,8,FDecember 2022 and Kyran Smith was
OL,9,Fjailed for seven and a half years in
OL,10,FJanuary for sexual assault and trespass
OL,11,Fwith intent to commit a relevant sexual
OL,12,Foffence.
OL,14,FMaidenhead's MP Joshua Reynolds said it
OL,15,Fwas a matter of time before Boydell
OL,16,Fleft the company.
